==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] (1,000%) spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**5 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns.
**2 [[CTO Seal]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Stall the Owlbrows with [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Mohawk Cats]] until you max out your wallet. Keep using your Cat Cannon to sync them up if they ever start pushing. Once you're ready, send out [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] and [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] while also stacking [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cats]], [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cats]], and [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cats]]. Other good gacha options are [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] to kill Teacher Bun Bun, or [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] to keep him in place. If you want, you can enable [[Battle Items#Cat CPU|Cat CPU]], because from this point on, it's just spamming your cats until you inevitably break through. The Owlbrows supply you with such unfathomable cash, it could devalue an entire economy.

